# Local-only Darts v2.19 archive snapshot (do not publish)
games/darts/v2.19/

# Local-only app docs / specs (non-public)
games/hanafuda/docs/
games/matchmaking/docs/

# Local-only working notes for Claude Code (do not publish)
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md

# Sudoku: generator-side ledger, developer PC only (server spec 3.3)
.recorded.json

# Sudoku: puzzle data is committed once, as the built output under games/sudoku/data.
# The source-side copy is byte-identical, so tracking both would double the repo cost
# (~2MB of JSON per copy). To restore it after a fresh clone:
#   cp -r games/sudoku/data/* games/sudoku-src/public/data/
# Without it, `npm run build` produces an app with no puzzles.
games/sudoku-src/public/data/

# Windows thumbnail cache (never publish)
Thumbs.db
**/Thumbs.db

# ★材料（ソース分離型アプリの -src フォルダ）は公開リポに記録しない（2026-11-07 利用者の指示）。
#   公開するのは出来上がり（games/<app>/・tools/<app>/）だけ。材料は手元にだけ置く。
#   すでに記録した分は履歴に残るが、これ以上は増やさない。見張り＝.git/hooks/pre-commit
*-src/
